eg group's pivot is at hip local y=0.8, so world hip = (floorY-0.35)+0.8 = floorY+0.45 ✓ fine. Nothing actually drawn below origin except nothing. So no clipping. Good — implement SIT as `group.position.y = floorY - 0.35` where floorY is the agent's current floor base, and STAND restores to floorY (or car floor).\n\nHmm but for chairs with seat height ~0.45, hip at 0.45 matches ✓.\n\n- STAND: clear sitting; restore y = floorY (or car local if in car).\n- RELEASE_SEAT: remove from seatReservations.\n- WAIT_SIM(minutes): untilMin resolved at start.\n- EXIT_BUILDING: remove group from scene, state GONE.\n- ENTER_STATE(state), MARK_LUNCHED, PICK_NEXT_ACTIVITY → call chooseNextActivity which replaces plan.\n\nPlan representation: array of actions; agent.currentAction index pointer. When action completes, advance and start next. Dispatch loop up to 16 iterations per frame — but WALK_TO_WP is multi-frame so it returns false quickly each iteration (only one iteration does work). Fine.\n\nNow spawn: agents start AWAY with schedules; when simMinute >= arrivalTime → state ARRIVING, plan = planArriveToDesk (workers) or planVisitorVisit (visitors), and group added to scene at `outside` node with jitter.\n\nWorkers' desk assignment: 20 workers but desks = 4 per floor × 5 floors = 20 ✓ exactly. Good — MAX_WORKERS=20 matches desks.\n\nVisitors: 80 slots, recycled.\n\nNow HUD update each frame; keep DOM updates cheap (update text only when changed).\n\nLet me also handle `applyOccupancy` and day-wrap reset.\n\nLighting keyframes: array of {hour, bg, sunColor, sunIntensity, ambient, hemi}. Interpolate.\n\nOK. Also need `world.floors[i].callPanel` with setUp/setDown/setIndicator; shaft indicator with setIndicator.\n\nLet me now write the files. I'll be careful about global name collisions across classic scripts:\n- person.js: createPerson, animatePersonWalking, palettes (const names: SHIRT_PALETTE, SKIN_PALETTE, PANTS_PALETTE).\n- world.js: WORLD, bfsPath, createWorld, plus helpers wi